---
import YogaLayout from '../../../layouts/YogaLayout.astro';
---
<YogaLayout title="Setsuko Hata Yoga | Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga Teacher"
  description="Authentic Hatha Yoga with Setsuko Hata, one of only four Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga teachers in Japan. Trial classes, Surya Shakti, and Surya Kriya in Osaka."
  locale="en"
  active="home"
  ogTitle="Setsuko Hata Yoga Studio"
  ogDescription="Authentic Hatha Yoga instruction by a Sadhguru Certified teacher, trained over 1,750 hours in India. Classes in Tokyo and Osaka, and corporate wellness programs."
  themeColor="#EEF0E6"
  alternateHref="/hatha-yoga/ja/"
  preloadHero
>

<section
          class="relative h-[92vh] min-h-[640px] w-full overflow-hidden bg-brand-espresso text-white"
        >
          <picture
            ><source
              type="image/webp"
              media="(max-width: 900px)"
              srcset="/hatha-yoga/assets/hero-900.webp" />
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/hatha-yoga/assets/hero.webp" />
            <source
              type="image/jpeg"
              media="(max-width: 900px)"
              srcset="/hatha-yoga/assets/hero-900.jpg" />
            <img
              src="/hatha-yoga/assets/hero.jpg"
              alt="Setsuko Hata beside a garden stream"
              width="1700"
              height="1275"
              class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[72%_12%] lg:object-[center_12%]"
              fetchpriority="high"
          /></picture>
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(249,243,231,.94) 0%,rgba(247,240,224,.85) 32%,rgba(247,240,224,.45) 46%,rgba(247,240,224,.1) 58%,rgba(247,240,224,0) 68%)"
          ></div>
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(247,240,224,.25),transparent 30%)"
          ></div>
          <div
            class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-10 relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-center pt-24 md:pt-28"
          >
            <div
              class="max-w-2xl motion-safe:animate-[brand-fade-up_900ms_ease-out]"
            >
              <p
                class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-brand-moss"
              >
                One of only four in Japan · Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga Teacher
              </p>
              <h1
                class="mt-6 whitespace-pre-line font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] md:text-7xl text-brand-espresso"
              >
                Beyond the body, into life itself.
              </h1>
              <p
                class="mt-8 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso md:text-lg"
              >
                Authentic Hatha Yoga, refined through 1,750 hours of training in India. Not fitness &mdash; a precise science for unlocking what life makes possible.
              </p>
              <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5">
                <a
                  href="/hatha-yoga/en/contact/"
                  class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-[14px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium transition-colors duration-300 active:translate-y-px bg-brand-moss text-white hover:bg-brand-espresso"
                  >Book a Private Consultation</a
                ><a
                  href="/hatha-yoga/en/offerings/"
                  class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[14px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-cream transition-transform active:translate-y-px"
                  ><span class="relative pb-1"
                    >See the Programs<span
                      class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-brand-cream transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-0"
                    ></span
                    ><span
                      class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-right scale-x-0 bg-brand-cream transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100"
                    ></span></span
                  ><span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
                    >&rarr;</span
                  ></a
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 z-10 -translate-x-1/2 text-center"
          >
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-brand-espresso"
            >
              Scroll
            </p>
            <div
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="mx-auto mt-3 h-8 w-px bg-white/40 motion-safe:animate-pulse"
            ></div>
          </div>
        </section>
      <section class="bg-[#f5efe6] py-24 md:py-32">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
          <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">What is Hatha Yoga</p>
          <h2 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl leading-[1.3] md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]">Working so hard, and still, the tiredness never quite lifts.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/80">Stiffness in the shoulders and neck. Shallow sleep. Stress.<br />Has your body, and even your mind, stopped feeling like there's any room left?</p>

          <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-20">
            <p class="text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">Hatha Yoga is a practice passed down for thousands of years to restore the wellbeing we're meant to have &mdash; built for people living exactly this kind of modern life.</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">Yoga is often pictured as stretching, or an exercise to loosen the body.<br />But that's not what Hatha Yoga, in its true form, actually is.<br />It is a highly refined practice that carefully aligns body, breath, and mind, one at a time, to draw out the life force we already carry within us.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-20 bg-brand-cream/70 px-8 py-14 text-center md:px-16 md:py-20">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl leading-snug md:text-4xl">&ldquo;Ha&rdquo; is the sun. &ldquo;Tha&rdquo; is the moon.</p>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-loose text-brand-espresso/80">Activity and rest, tension and ease, yin and yang &mdash; all already within us.<br />As these two energies come into balance, body and mind harmonize naturally, and we return to our own natural lightness.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-20">
            <p class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl">With continued practice,</p>
            <div class="mt-10 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
              <div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">01</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Posture aligns</p>
            </div>
<div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">02</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Flexibility and strength increase</p>
            </div>
<div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">03</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">The autonomic nervous system and hormones find balance more easily</p>
            </div>
<div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">04</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Internal organ function and metabolism activate</p>
            </div>
<div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">05</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Sleep quality improves</p>
            </div>
<div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">06</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Focus and clarity of thought sharpen</p>
            </div>
<div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">07</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Stress has less power over you</p>
            </div>
<div class="border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-5">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">08</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">You tire less, and each day fills with more vitality</p>
            </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-12 max-w-2xl leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">This is the defining quality of Hatha Yoga: it works not only on the body, but on the mind, and on life energy itself.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ja-band ja-band-sand py-24 md:py-36">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
          <figure class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
            <blockquote class="font-display text-2xl leading-[1.4] md:text-4xl md:leading-[1.35]">The word yoga itself means &ldquo;to unite.&rdquo;</blockquote>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl leading-loose text-brand-espresso">Body and mind coming into harmony. Finding your way back to a connection with yourself.<br />And living each day a little more at ease, a little more alive.<br />That is what Hatha Yoga, at its heart, is reaching for.</p>
            <div class="mx-auto mt-10 flex justify-center" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-px w-16 bg-brand-clay"></span></div>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl leading-loose text-brand-espresso">Body and mind aren't limits on a life &mdash; they're the instruments meant to enrich it.<br />Hatha Yoga is the lifelong practice of carefully tending those instruments, and drawing out the possibility already inside them.</p>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="bg-brand-cream/60 py-24 md:py-32">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-10">
          <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">About the Teacher</p>
          <div class="mt-10 grid items-start gap-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] md:gap-20">
            <div class="md:sticky md:top-28">
              <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
                <picture>
                  <source type="image/webp" srcset="/hatha-yoga/assets/setsuko-about.webp" />
                  <img src="/hatha-yoga/assets/setsuko-about.jpg" alt="Setsuko Hata" loading="lazy" width="816" height="698" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                </picture>
              </div>
              <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl">Setsuko Hata</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">秦 節子</p>
              <dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/15 pt-6">
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl">13<span class="text-base">yrs</span></dt>
                  <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/70">As a jazz singer and composer</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl">1,750<span class="text-base">+hrs</span></dt>
                  <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/70">Of professional training</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl">1<span class="text-base">of 4</span></dt>
                  <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/70">Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga teachers in Japan</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-7 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">
              <p>At 21, after a period when her own body and mind fell seriously out of balance, Setsuko began a long search: what does real health actually mean, and how can a person draw out the fullest possibility of the life they carry?</p>
              <p>That search took her to the United States, where she spent 13 years working as a jazz singer and composer. Through music, meeting countless people along the way, a different question grew louder &mdash; not just for the body, but for something that could enrich a person's whole life. In 2024, that question led her to the Isha Yoga Center in South India, founded by the world-renowned yogi Sadhguru.</p>
              <p>She lived at the ashram for roughly a year and a half, practicing yoga and meditation daily, and completed the Hatha Yoga teacher training course &mdash; widely regarded as one of the most rigorous yoga teacher certifications in the world. After more than 1,750 hours of dedicated training, she earned certification as a Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga Teacher.</p>
              <p>Today, as one of only four Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga teachers in Japan, she teaches the traditional Hatha Yoga carried down from its origins in India, based primarily in Osaka and Tokyo.</p>
              <div class="border-l-2 border-brand-moss/50 bg-[#f5efe6] px-7 py-8">
                <p class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">My own life changed enormously through yoga.</p>
                <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-loose text-brand-espresso/80">There was a time when stress and physical imbalance would take hold of me easily. But through the continued practice of Hatha Yoga, I found I could stay calm no matter the circumstance, and I was no longer thrown so easily by whatever was happening around me.</p>
                <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-loose text-brand-espresso/80">As my life energy rose, I became remarkably resistant to fatigue. Waking up in the morning became something to look forward to, and I began to feel genuine joy simply in living each day.</p>
                <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-loose text-brand-espresso/80">Things I once believed I &ldquo;couldn't do&rdquo; became things I could naturally attempt &mdash; and I felt my own sense of what was possible expand.</p>
              </div>
              <p>I don't believe this change came from any special talent. I believe it came from continuing a genuine Hatha Yoga practice, which brought body, mind, and life energy into alignment, and let me return to who I really am.</p>
              <p>That is why I want to bring this remarkable tradition to as many people as possible &mdash; spreading authentic Hatha Yoga across Japan, so that each person can become healthy in body and mind, and shine as fully themselves.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="bg-[#f5efe6] py-24 md:py-32">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
          <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">Trial Class</p>
          <h2 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl leading-[1.3] md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]">Why not experience authentic Hatha Yoga, carried down from its origins in India?</h2>

          <div class="mt-16 grid gap-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.3fr] md:gap-20">
            <div class="bg-brand-cream/70 px-8 py-10">
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/70">In the rush of daily life, do any of these sound familiar?</p>
              <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
                <p class="font-display text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85 md:text-xl">&ldquo;The tiredness never really lifts&rdquo;</p>
<p class="font-display text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85 md:text-xl">&ldquo;My shoulders are tense, my posture worries me&rdquo;</p>
<p class="font-display text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85 md:text-xl">&ldquo;There's too much stress, no room left in my mind&rdquo;</p>
<p class="font-display text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85 md:text-xl">&ldquo;My sleep is shallow&rdquo;</p>
<p class="font-display text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85 md:text-xl">&ldquo;I want more energy in my everyday life&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/70">Does any of this sound like you?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-7 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">
              <p>Hatha Yoga isn't simply poses, stretching, or exercise.<br />It's a practice with a history spanning thousands of years, one that aligns body, breath, mind, and life energy to draw out the wellbeing and possibility you already carry.</p>
              <p class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl">With continued practice,</p>
              <div class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Posture aligns and the body feels lighter</p>
            </div>
<div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Shoulder and neck tension eases, toward a body that tires less</p>
            </div>
<div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Breath deepens, and the autonomic nervous system finds balance more easily</p>
            </div>
<div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Supports hormonal balance and steadies body and mind</p>
            </div>
<div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Focus and clarity sharpen, lifting performance at work and in daily life</p>
            </div>
<div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Stress has less power over you, and a calmer mind takes root</p>
            </div>
<div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Supports organ function and metabolism, toward a healthier body from within</p>
            </div>
<div class="flex gap-4 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-lg leading-none">🌿</span>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">Life energy rises, and each day feels more vivid</p>
            </div>
              </div>
              <p>It's not only the body that changes. The mind changes, and slowly, the way you live changes too.<br />That is the real appeal of authentic Hatha Yoga.</p>
              <div class="border-l-2 border-brand-moss/50 pl-6">
                <p class="text-sm leading-loose text-brand-espresso/80">Beginners and those with stiff bodies are warmly welcome.<br />Instruction is given carefully, at each person's own pace &mdash; so please feel free to join, even if this is your very first time on a mat.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="ja-band ja-band-sage py-24 md:py-32">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-[1.3] text-brand-espresso md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.2]">Why not join us for a trial class?</h2>
            <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">It might be the first step toward changing your life.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-4xl gap-px bg-white/15 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="bg-brand-moss px-8 py-8">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">Schedule</p>
              <div class="mt-5 space-y-5">
                <div>
                  <p class="font-display text-xl text-brand-espresso">Thursday</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-brand-espresso">9:30&ndash;10:45AM</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-brand-espresso">11:00&ndash;12:15PM</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-display text-xl text-brand-espresso">Saturday</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-brand-espresso">9:30&ndash;10:45AM</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-brand-espresso">11:00AM&ndash;12:15 PM</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-brand-moss px-8 py-8">
              <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">Venue</p>
              <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">Osaka City Kyoiku Kaikan<br />(1-1-38 Hoenzaka, Chuo-ku, Osaka)</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">About 10 minutes on foot from Morinomiya, Tanimachi 4-chome, or Osakajokoen stations</p>
              <p class="mt-7 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">Fee</p>
              <p class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl text-brand-espresso">4,000 yen</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">Please come on a light stomach, in clothing you can move in</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-4xl text-center">
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-espresso">Teacher: Setsuko Hata, Sadhguru Gurukulam Certified Hatha Yoga Teacher</p>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1rKoOxcGQyew2a_d341eduWZ4QuhbK7R3YloP14Z6s8w/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white px-10 py-4 text-[14px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-espresso transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-brand-tan active:translate-y-px">Apply for the Trial Class</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="bg-brand-cream/60 py-24 md:py-32">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
          <p class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">Recommended Programs</p>
          <h2 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl leading-[1.3] md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.2]">Surya Shakti<br />Surya Kriya</h2>
          <div class="mt-8 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-base leading-loose text-brand-espresso/85">
            <p>Authentic Hatha Yoga programs, carried down for thousands of years in India.<br />They harmonize the solar cycle with your own life, aligning body, mind, and life energy from within.</p>
            <p>Unlike ordinary yoga or stretching, this is a powerful practice that brings transformation at the level of the body and its energy.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="border border-brand-espresso/15 bg-[#f5efe6] flex flex-col px-9 py-10">
              <p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🔥</p>
              <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-2xl leading-snug md:text-3xl">Surya Shakti</h3>
              <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-loose text-brand-espresso/80">A traditional Hatha Yoga practice that raises life energy and builds a body that is both supple and strong.</p>
              <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss">Expected Benefits</p>
              <ul class="mt-5 flex-1 space-y-3 border-t border-brand-espresso/10 pt-5">
                <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">
                  <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-brand-moss">─</span><span>Raises life energy and vitality</span>
                </li>
<li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso/85">
